<title>SINGAPORE: BADMINTON - SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON - SINGAPORE OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter final results from</p>
<p>the Konica Cup Singapore International Badminton Championships</p>
<p>on Friday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Sun Jun (China) beat Marleve Mainaky (Indonesia) 5-15 15-3</p>
<p>15-2</p>
<p>Indra Wijaya (Indonesia) beat Geroge Rimarodi (Indonesia)</p>
<p>15-1 15-5</p>
<p>Ardy Wiranta (Indonesia) beat Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) 15-17</p>
<p>15-9 15-6</p>
<p>Arbi Heryanto (Indonesia) beat Jason Wong (Malaysia) 2-15</p>
<p>15-4 15-7</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao (China) beat Yu Hua (China) 11-3 11-7</p>
<p>Kim Ji Hyun (South Korea) beat Judith Meulendijks</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 11-7 12-10</p>
<p>Zhang Ning (China) beat Lee Joo Hyun (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-4-11-7</p>
<p>Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Pornsawan Plungwech (Thailand)</p>
<p>11-1 11-5</p>
</text>
